kaise pardes mai kazim pe zamanay aaye <br>
haye mazdoor janazay ko uthaney aaye <br>
<br>
1. chord aye hai najaf aur madina saaren <br>
tu lawaris nahi zahra kay aye betay pyaare <br>
aa mera laal tujhe saare lejane aaye <br>
<br>
2. hogayi qaid khatam musa kazim mere <br>
qaidkhane se nikal aao mai sadqay tere <br>
baqiya wale hai tera sog banane aye <br>
<br>
3. aap zinda'an mai hai ghar mai hai sog bapa <br>
betiyaan musa e kazim ki yeh deti hai sada <br>
kaash kay baba humay seenay lagane aaye <br>
<br>
4. qaid main kehte rahe sathway mere imam <br>
haye kazim ya sakina ho ya baghdad ya shaam <br>
hum toh nana hai tera deen bachane aaye